            <div xml:id="d597-a2">

                <pb facs="1051" n="951" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg951"/>

                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">The Federal Council decrees</hi>:</p>
                <p>The foregoing law, published the 30th of January, 1875, will go into effect in
                    accordance with article 89 of the federal constitution and the federal decree of
                    July 1, 1875, and will have the force of law from the 1st of January, 1876.</p>
                <p>Berne, the 7th of July, 1875.</p>
                <p>In the name of the Swiss Federal Council.</p>
                <closer>The President of the confederation:<lb/><signed>SCHERER.</signed><lb/>The
                    chancellor of the confederation:<lb/><signed>SCHIESS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
